{
  "comment": [
    "Every FFM downcall the engine makes. See spec/GRAALVM.md section 3.",
    "",
    "GraalVM cannot generate a downcall stub at run time, so each distinct function signature has to be",
    "declared here. The symbol name does not matter, only the shape: one entry covers every function that",
    "shares it. Layout names are the keys of Linker.canonicalLayouts() - jint for JAVA_INT, jlong for",
    "JAVA_LONG, void* for ADDRESS - and not the names of the ValueLayout constants.",
    "",
    "A 'comment' inside a downcall entry is a parse error and inside a resource entry is a warning, so the",
    "mapping back to the code lives up here:",
    "",
    "  jint()                                  mlg_version                     NativeCapabilities",
    "  jlong()                                 mlg_capabilities, mlg_cqe_size  NativeCapabilities, NativeBindings",
    "  jint(jint)                              close(2), fsync(2)              NativeLib",
    "  jlong(jint)                             mlg_cqe_offset                  NativeBindings",
    "  jlong(jint,jlong,jint)                  lseek(2), SEEK_DATA/SEEK_HOLE   NativeLib",
    "  jint(jint,jint,jint)                    ioctl(2), for FICLONE           NativeLib",
    "  jint(jint,jint,jlong,jlong)             fallocate(2)                    NativeLib",
    "  jint(void*,jint,jint)                   open(2)                         NativeLib",
    "  jint(void*,jlong,jint)                  madvise(2)                      NativeLib",
    "  jint(jint,jlong,jlong,jint)             posix_fadvise(2)                NativeLib",
    "  jlong(jint,void*,jlong,jlong)           pread(2), pwrite(2)             NativeLib",
    "  jint(jint,void*,jint,jint,void*)        statx(2)                        NativeLib",
    "  jlong(void*,jlong,void*,jlong)          mlg_lz4_compress                NativeCodec",
    "  void*(jint)                             mlg_ring_new                    UringIoEngine",
    "  void(void*)                             mlg_ring_free                   UringIoEngine",
    "  jint(void*,jint)                        mlg_ring_submit                 UringIoEngine",
    "  jint(void*,void*,jint)                  mlg_ring_reap                   UringIoEngine",
    "  jint(void*,jint,void*,jint,jlong,jlong) mlg_ring_submit_read            UringIoEngine",
    "",
    "ForeignDowncallMetadataTest reads this file and those five classes and fails when they disagree.",
    "",
    "The single resource is the Rust crate, which NativeCapabilities.fromClasspath unpacks to a temporary",
    "file and dlopens. Without it the image runs on the pure-Java fallback, exactly as the jar does.",
    "",
    "The reflection entries are the JCA provider classes PasswordHash reaches through",
    "SecretKeyFactory.getInstance(\"PBKDF2WithHmacSHA512\"). A service lookup is reflective, so without these",
    "the image throws NoSuchAlgorithmException at RUN time - never at build time - and the first symptom is an",
    "operator concluding they have forgotten their password. See spec/AUTH.md section 4.2.",
    "",
    "They live here rather than in graph-server because both native binaries need them: metaloom-graph-cli",
    "generates and hashes a password in 'auth reset-admin', and tools/native-image.sh already relies on the",
    "CLI inheriting graph-core's registrations rather than carrying any of its own."
  ],
